{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27247","headline":"送金可纪归新罗 · 章孝标","name":"送金可纪归新罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登唐科第语唐音，望日初生忆故林。\n鲛室夜眠阴火冷，蜃楼朝泊晓霞深。\n风高一叶飞鱼背，潮净三山出海心。\n想把文章合夷乐，蟠桃花里醉人参。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}